  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for improving the lives of African citizens by ensuring policy is informed by evidence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Abdul Latif Jameel Poverty Action Lab for Africa (J-PAL Africa), based at the University of Cape Town, works to ensure that policymaking in Africa is informed by rigorous evidence. This grant will help J-PAL Africa bridge the gap between research and action by generating rigorous evidence when it is lacking and strengthening capacity to use evidence among policymakers.</narrative>
  </description>
